  "semantic": {
    "lines": [
      "Actually Goblins are not intelligent enough to ",
      "move in formation.",
      "However with unknown reason, They are moving in ",
      "formation and marching towards the town gate.",
      "We need to organize our militia and defend our ",
      "town quickly.",
      "",
      "First I'll give you a ring and amulet to defeat ",
      "the Goblins.",
      "",
      "When you equip your ring and amulet, they will ",
      "increase your life, stamina and mana.",
      "Anyway I have to report this message to our Knight ",
      "leader. May the bless of Awell be with you... ",
      "",
